{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13731","headline":"乌啼曲二首 一 · 顾况","name":"乌啼曲二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉房掣锁声翻叶，银箭添泉遶霜堞。\n毕逋拨刺月衔城，八九雏飞其母惊。\n此是天上老鵶鸣，人间老鵶无此声。\n摇风杂佩耿华烛，夜听羽人弹此曲。\n东方曈曈赤日旭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13731.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13731","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}